Package: gnome-shell-extension-magic-mirror
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 46~), gnome-shell (<< 47~), ${misc:Depends}
Description: one-click switch between a saved display layout and the laptop screen
 Magic Mirror adds an Apple-like switch to the GNOME Shell top bar. It toggles
 between one saved multi-monitor layout and the built-in display only, using
 the same Mutter API as GNOME Settings.
